Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 01:23:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 186/307] refactor: remove the cascade-borrow RSM fallback path

The dedicated e_LPVRsm view has been the default and the proven path
since the stability overhaul; the r_LPVDedicatedRSM 0 fallback (borrow
the sun cascade selected by r_LPVCascadeLod as the RSM) was the
pre-dedicated transition scheme and is dead weight - and it was the only
remaining piece that touched the regular sun cascade flow (the
SunDynamic condition in CShadowMapStage::PreparePassIDForFrustum).

SVOGI needs no restoration: the final hooks are purely additive with
absolute SVOGI priority (LPV only fills the RSM targets when SVOGI
returned none and steps aside completely while it is active).

Removes r_LPVDedicatedRSM and r_LPVCascadeLod.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tu9cj9ax1mqCV93HVfCfpW
